{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "\n\n[相关档案](": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\n[Related Files]("
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\n[関連ファイル]("
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\n[관련 파일]("
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\n[相关档案]("
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n        MoMo Agent 主动导出\n\n        导出时间：%@\n        这是手机当前已接收资料的快照，不代表全天声音已完整采集、接收或转写。\n        原音按分片保留，没有拼接或补齐缺口。recording.json 保存各分片的时钟、帧范围和校验值。\n        仅复制仍可读取且通过校验的原音。audioOmission 标明未导出的分片：expired 为已过期，expiry_pending 为正在清理，missing_unexpected 为文件缺失，not_requested 为本次未选择原音。\n        epochs.notReceived 是已知范围内尚未收到的帧；unknownTailFromFrame 之后的范围仍未知，不能当作静音或完整录音。\n        转录仅包含此时已完成的文字；后续转写和修改不会更新这份副本。\n        你保存或分享出去的文件由目标位置管理，App 的原音保留期不会删除这些副本。\n        ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n        MoMo Agent Manual Export\n\n        Exported at: %@\n        This is a snapshot of data currently received on your iPhone and does not represent a complete capture, transfer, or transcription of the entire day.\n        Original audio is preserved in chunks without stitching or gap-filling. recording.json stores clocks, frame ranges, and checksums for each chunk.\n        Only readable and verified audio chunks are copied. audioOmission indicates omitted chunks: expired, expiry_pending, missing_unexpected, or not_requested.\n        epochs.notReceived lists frames not yet received within the known range; anything after unknownTailFromFrame is unknown and must not be treated as silence or complete audio.\n        Transcripts include only text completed at export time; subsequent transcriptions or edits will not update this copy.\n        Exported or shared files are managed by their destination and will not be deleted by the app's audio retention policy.\n        "
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n        MoMo Agent 主动导出\n\n        导出时间：%@\n        这是手机当前已接收资料的快照，不代表全天声音已完整采集、接收或转写。\n        原音按分片保留，没有拼接或补齐缺口。recording.json 保存各分片的时钟、帧范围和校验值。\n        仅复制仍可读取且通过校验的原音。audioOmission 标明未导出的分片：expired 为已过期，expiry_pending 为正在清理，missing_unexpected 为文件缺失，not_requested 为本次未选择原音。\n        epochs.notReceived 是已知范围内尚未收到的帧；unknownTailFromFrame 之后的范围仍未知，不能当作静音或完整录音。\n        转录仅包含此时已完成的文字；后续转写和修改不会更新这份副本。\n        你保存或分享出去的文件由目标位置管理，App 的原音保留期不会删除这些副本。\n        "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n…显示已截短；原始执行结果仍保存在会话中。": {
      "comment": "Chat renderer UI. Keep {0}, {1} and other numbered arguments unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n…display truncated; original execution results remain in the session."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n…表示が切り詰められています。元の実行結果はセッションに残ります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n…디스플레이가 잘렸습니다. 원래 실행 결과는 세션에 남아 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n…显示已截短；原始执行结果仍保存在会话中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
