    "回听已被系统打断。确认播放设备后，点播放继续。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Listening back has been interrupted by the system. After confirming the playback device, click Play to continue."
