    "转发需支持 SSE，关闭响应缓冲；保留鉴权与事件游标请求头，无需额外网页登录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Relay must support SSE with response buffering disabled, preserving auth and cursor headers without web login."
